                    {"Version":"V8.92","Change":"Breakout Snapshot + Maturity Calibration: cards-first trend UI, immutable freeze workflow, separate breakout/roster-value/acquisition-urgency diagnostics, contribution waterfalls, maturity funnel, horizon-by-position calibration, lead-time/market timing, and richer false-positive taxonomy","Guardrail":"Diagnostic learning only; Production breakout/regression scores remain unchanged and only mature multi-week evidence can enter shadow experimentation"},
